      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Browser = ShopCouponsPage + couponService + Axios. Account holder may have any role; the expanded successful request is SHOP_MANAGER. A denied request stops immediately: later messages belong only to the permitted path. Errors return through NestJS exception handling; no controller call occurs after guard rejection.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2595,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "NestJS pipeline is a framework participant. JWT self-messages summarize Passport + JwtStrategy + Prisma delegation. Invalid/missing/expired JWT or absent/inactive/deleted User: 401 before RolesGuard. Passport sets request.user from the reloaded User; its database role governs access.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2645,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "@Roles stores metadata under ROLES_KEY = roles. Reflector reads handler first, then controller. Missing metadata or an empty role array returns true immediately; RolesGuard alone does not authenticate. Non-empty roles plus missing request.user or role mismatch: 403. No role hierarchy or automatic Admin bypass exists.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2700,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Actual coupon RBAC examples: Admin createPlatformCoupon = SYSTEM_ADMIN or SYSTEM_MANAGER; Shop createStoreCoupon / approveCoupon = SHOP_MANAGER; KOL proposeCoupon = COLLABORATOR. Store controller metadata also allows Admin/Manager for inherited methods, but approveCoupon overrides that list to SHOP_MANAGER only.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2755,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Controller delegates to CouponsService (see FR12): recheck SHOP_MANAGER; require Store.ownerId = userId; apply approval policy and writes. Another Shop owner gets 403; missing Store gets 404. Service internals are omitted. RolesGuard itself performs no DB query, ownership check or KYC check.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2810,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Selected protected route only: guards are bound explicitly by @UseGuards, not a universal application-wide policy. FR9 uses its own StoreOwnerGuard. Frontend RoleGuard controls workspace navigation; backend guards enforce API access independently. Library base classes and DTO/pipes/interceptor internals are omitted.",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 2865,
      "w": 3360,
      "h": 44,
      "size": 19,
      "align": "left",
      "bold": false
    }
  ]
}